@prefix gh: <https://gftd.ai/gh#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

gh:ObjectDesign a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:label "Object Design"@en .
gh:VehicleDesign a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:label "Vehicle Design"@en .
gh:BuildingDesign a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:label "Building Design"@en .
gh:Infrastructure a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:label "Infrastructure"@en .

gh:concept a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
gh:designPrinciples a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:ObjectDesign .
gh:generationPrompt a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
gh:propulsionSystem a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:VehicleDesign ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
gh:structure a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
gh:energy a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
gh:interior a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain gh:ObjectDesign ; rdfs:range xsd:string .


